# RFC 7606 Section 3.g keep-first decode: an UPDATE carrying TWO ORIGIN attributes
# (IGP first, EGP second) decodes with the FIRST ORIGIN kept (igp), not the last, and
# does not error. This matches the session's enforceRFC7606 duplicate strip so
# `ze bgp decode` diagnostics agree with on-session behavior (spec D-4b).
